@host = http://localhost:3001

### Verificar saúde
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Buscar métricas
GET {{host}}/api/dashboar

### Buscar Faturas
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

### Buscar fatura pelo identificador
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/1

### Buscar fatura por identificado nao disponivel
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/9999

### Buscar fatura por identificado INVALIDO
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/abc

### Criar Fatura
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId":1,
    "amount": 125035,
    "status": "peding",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}